<metadata><name>Snowlands 1217 Herring Creek Loop</name><desc>broken (legs do not join end to end) + spur to 2. 6.9 miles round trip or 7.3 miles round trip by alternate return route. Line traced from Marcus Libkind's map, tours.snowlands.org/tours/12/1217_tour.htm</desc></metadata>
